        </div>

        <p>The dataset covers <strong>6 distinct fuel types</strong>: E10 (standard unleaded), B7_STANDARD (standard diesel), E5 (super unleaded), B7_PREMIUM (premium diesel), B10, and HVO (hydrotreated vegetable oil). E10 and B7_STANDARD account for the majority of records, reflecting their status as the most commonly purchased fuels at UK forecourts.</p>
