        <div class="callout">
            <strong>Compliance concern:</strong> {total_stale:,} records exceed the 7-day freshness threshold. These stale records primarily affect {worst_lag_fuel} data. For the government's open data scheme to provide useful price transparency to consumers, prompt retailer reporting is essential — stale data undermines the policy objective of enabling informed consumer choice.
