        <p>On average, each station reports <strong>{fuel_per_station.mean():.1f}</strong> fuel types. <strong>{stations_one_only:,} stations</strong> report only a single fuel type, while <strong>{stations_all_four:,}</strong> report all fuel types present in the dataset. This uneven coverage means price comparisons across all fuel types are not possible for a substantial number of stations.</p>
